# Every other single-block fixture kills at least one side; this is the
# plain case where neither creature's damage reaches the other's toughness
# at all. Two vanilla Devoted Heroes (1/2) block each other: each deals 1,
# short of the other's 2 toughness -- both survive, damage marked but no
# state-based action moves either to the graveyard.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
